<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Kakinada cargoes - Jan 6.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Kakinada cargoes - Jan 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Kakinada port on January 6:</p>
<p>  Commodity		Tons		Ship/Name	 Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD)(Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Fertilisers	     Nil</p>
<p>Agricultural</p>
<p>  Products	  9,857 (LDD)  1,143   M.V.Yuan Da	   16/12</p>
<p>Agricultural</p>
<p>  Products	  4,701 (LDD)  6,319   Da Cheng		28/12</p>
<p>Agricultural</p>
<p>  Products	  1,237 (LDD)  2,263   Calarasi		01/01</p>
<p> Rice Loading	   Nil</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>	    - All sections of labour (stevedoring, shore labour &amp;</p>
<p>lorry workers) are on strike since January 1 demanding enhanced wages, etc.</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Kakinada)</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
